---
/**
 * The book still life (IOS_SPEC 2.5): the site's one pale mat with
 * Replaceable standing on it in perspective, flat book colours only (no
 * shadow: a blurred shadow paints colours the brand book does not list). The
 * book is one flat plane turned in perspective with its
 * binding drawn along the left edge (a preserve-3d spine loses the book's
 * lower half in Chromium when its top is scrolled out of view). The cover
 * is the book's real cover (ISBN 0998174475), served as WebP with a JPEG
 * fallback. The page sizes the mat and the book.
 */
---
<div class="mat io-bookmat rise-obj" style="--d:.3s">
  <figure class="io-book" role="img" aria-label="The cover of Replaceable.">
    <span class="io-book-spine" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="io-book-face">
      <picture>
        <source srcset="/images/replaceable-cover.webp" type="image/webp" />
        <img src="/images/replaceable-cover.jpg" alt="" width="1000" height="1499" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </picture>
    </span>
  </figure>
</div>
